<summary-of-references>
This reference module provides:

- Complete documentation and links for CDO, NetCDF, GRIB, and CF
  conventions
- Comprehensive list of climate data sources (reanalysis, observations,
  projections)
- FAQ section addressing common CDO errors and solutions
- Best practices checklist for data management and reproducibility
- Glossary of key climate data terminology
- Quick reference of most frequently used CDO commands
- All references cited throughout the 12-module course

`{tip} Bookmark this reference module for quick access during your climate data analysis work. The best practices checklist (Section I) is particularly useful when setting up new analysis projects.`

